Chapter: QuireMapScript

  cites Foreword chapter Console
  cites Foreword chapter Maybe
  cites Shell chapter ShellTypes
  cites Shell chapter ShellBuild
  cites Shell chapter PowerShellEmit

 Generates quire-map.ps1 -- the single quire registry and cite resolver.
 Dot-source this file; never copy the map. Every script that resolves
 cites lines (bundlers, compile, test batch, plug builds, linters) must
 take $QuireDirs and $CitePat from here.

 We say:

Section: S01 -- QuireDirs hashtable

  s01 : List ShellCmd =
    [ScComment "The single quire registry and cite resolver. Dot-source this file;",
     ScComment "never copy the map. Every script that resolves",
     ScComment "  cites <Quire> chapter <Name>",
     ScComment "(bundlers, compile, test batch, plug builds, linters) must take",
     ScComment "$QuireDirs and $CitePat from here.",
     ScComment "Add new quires HERE and nowhere else. Paths are repo-relative.",
     ScBlank,
     ScRaw "$QuireDirs = @{",
     ScRaw "    'Foreword' = 'codex\\foreword\\core'; 'Kernel' = 'codex\\os\\kernel'; 'OS' = 'codex\\os\\core'",
     ScRaw "    'Works' = 'apps\\works'; 'Trust' = 'codex\\os\\trust'; 'Net' = 'codex\\os\\net'",
     ScRaw "    'Verify' = 'codex\\os\\verify'; 'Replay' = 'codex\\os\\replay'; 'Sched' = 'codex\\os\\sched'",
     ScRaw "    'Observe' = 'codex\\os\\observe'; 'Game' = 'codex\\foreword\\game'",
     ScRaw "    'Signal' = 'codex\\foreword\\signal'; 'Compress' = 'codex\\foreword\\compress'",
     ScRaw "    'Encode' = 'codex\\foreword\\encode'; 'Math' = 'codex\\foreword\\math'",
